      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "Hey Cassie, Aaralyn didn't latch on till she was about 3 weeks old but I kept pumping until then (she was too little because of being premie)... once she did then it was no problem, but it did get painful.  The Dr said I was feeding her too much and that's why my nipples got so sore and even bled at one point.  Once I got her on a good eating schedule, the painfullness stopped and I really enjoyed breastfeeding her.\nI hope little Kyle will latch right on for ya and you'll have no probs BF-ing 🙂\nWOO HOO, only 5 weeks left, I can't believe it!! 😀 Hope you're  feeling good hun!",
